  - other: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59dd8e2ccc51d09489b0212c36774432, type: 2}
    seal: 1
    line: "Yine ben! Ge\xE7en sefer balkona tak\u0131lmad\u0131n\u0131z, sa\u011F
      olun."
  - other: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59dd8e2ccc51d09489b0212c36774432, type: 2}
    seal: 2
    line: "Yine ben. Ge\xE7en sefer balkon y\xFCz\xFCnden geri \xE7evirdiniz, bu
      sefer her \u015Fey milimetrik."
  introLines:
  - "D\xFCn yine salland\u0131, de\u011Fil mi? B\xFCy\xFCk depremden beri han\u0131m
    geceleri uyuyam\u0131yor."
  - "D\xF6rt kat, kil zemin. H\u0131zl\u0131ca bakarsan\u0131z eve d\xF6nece\u011Fim."
  questions:
  - question: Bu sefer ne getirdiniz?
    answer: "Ne varsa k\xE2\u011F\u0131tta. \u0130sterseniz \xE7ekici de vurun."
  - question: "Siz depreme haz\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z?"
    answer: "\xC7antam\u0131z kap\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131nda. Siz de haz\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131
      olun, hocam."
  approvedLine: Kolay gelsin, kendinize dikkat edin.
  shearWallLine: Perde mi? Masraf ama... peki, ekletiriz.
  rejectedLine: Ne eksik ki? Neyse, siz bilirsiniz.
